                        "entry_id": "aad82351-5deb-3f64-860b-be2c0514ec07",
                        "glosses": [
                            "牛仔；特指通常不參加牛仔競技表演的職業牛仔"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "亦作定語"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4da2cccd-357e-42c8-9cd6-4941a225c500",
                                "sense_id": "9826eb3c-313a-39a7-a89f-6ce4f822004d",
                                "text": "No thanks, cowboy. If I was to let every rodeo hand I pulled a bull off of buy me liquor, I'd have been an alcoholic long ago. Pullin' bulls off of you buckaroos is just my job. So save your money for your next entry fee, cowboy.",
                                "translation": "不用了，牛仔。如果我讓每個被我從公牛身上拉下來的牛仔競技手請我喝酒，我早就成酒鬼了。把你們這些牛仔從公牛身上拉下來只是我的工作。所以把錢省下來付下次參賽費吧，牛仔。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4359c78-e695-35c3-9470-f8b97e066c97",
                        "entry_id": "aad82351-5deb-3f64-860b-be2c0514ec07",
